  "description": "PrintManager is an easy to use .NET API that allows software developers to dynamically print PDF files to any local or network printer.  PrintManager allows you to manage multiple print jobs, verify printer settings and handle successful or unsuccessful prints all from within one SDK.\n\nDynamicPDF PrintManager is backed by a great team of developers and support staff. Flexible licensing (including royalty free) is available to meet all your needs.\n\nRelease Notes:\n\n* Fixed an \"Arithmetic operation resulted in an overflow\" exception when printing a specific PDF document.",
